++Main patient form includes:
++- action buttons,
++- Many2one statusbar (`stage_id`),
++- smart/body buttons,
++- structured identity/contact/status groups,
++- Identifiers / Allergies / Conditions / Vitals notebook pages,
++- One2many object buttons,
++- chatter.
